OL,3,CRussia hits Kyiv with ballistic
OL,4,Cmissiles and drones, killing at least
OL,5,Cnine
OL,7,FAt least nine people were killed and
OL,8,F22 civilians injured in the Ukrainian
OL,9,Fcapital Kyiv after Russia launched an
OL,10,Fintense barrage of ballistic missiles
OL,11,Fand drones overnight into Saturday,
OL,12,Fauthorities said.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/10
