OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1785633475
OL,3,CRussia hits Kyiv with ballistic
OL,4,Cmissiles and drones, killing at least
OL,5,Cnine
OL,7,FA five-story residential building in
OL,8,Fthe city's Solomianskyi District was
OL,9,Fdamaged by falling debris, and a fire
OL,10,Fbroke out. Rescue workers evacuated 35
OL,11,Fpeople from the upper floors of the
OL,12,Fbuilding, and two people died, with
OL,13,Feight reported injured, including two
OL,14,Fchildren, according to Ukraine's state
OL,15,Femergency service.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/10
