OL,3,CRussia hits Kyiv with ballistic
OL,4,Cmissiles and drones, killing at least
OL,5,Cnine
OL,7,FIn the Darnytskyi District of Kyiv,
OL,8,Fseven people were killed, and another
OL,9,F14 injured after the attack caused
OL,10,Ffires and damage to houses, vehicles,
OL,11,Fan administrative and non-residential
OL,12,Fbuilding, the emergency services said.
OL,14,FElsewhere, emergency workers
OL,15,Fextinguished a fire in a non-
OL,16,Fresidential building in the capital's
OL,17,FShevchenkivskyi district. There was no
OL,18,Fadditional information about earlier
OL,19,Freports by the district mayor that
OL,20,Fpeople were trapped in another
OL,21,Fresidential building.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/10
