OL,3,CRussia hits Kyiv with ballistic
OL,4,Cmissiles and drones, killing at least
OL,5,Cnine
OL,7,FDamage to commercial and residential
OL,8,Fbuildings was reported in two other
OL,9,Fcity districts.
OL,11,FPresident Volodymyr Zelenskyy has
OL,12,Fpressed the United States and other
OL,13,FWestern partners over Ukraine's need
OL,14,Ffor more Patriot anti-ballistic
OL,15,Fmissile defence systems to counter
OL,16,Fmissile attacks from Russia.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/10
