OL,3,CRussia hits Kyiv with ballistic
OL,4,Cmissiles and drones, killing at least
OL,5,Cnine
OL,7,FThe Ukrainian leader late Friday said
OL,8,Fhe spoke to US Vice President JD Vance
OL,9,Fand discussed a meeting with President
OL,10,FDonald Trump earlier this week in
OL,11,FWashington, which Zelenskyy described
OL,12,Fas "positive and productive."
OL,14,F"The Russian air strikes on our
OL,15,Fcountry continue and air defence,
OL,16,Fspecifically interceptors for Patriot
OL,17,Fsystems against ballistic missiles,
OL,18,Fremains a top priority," Zelenskyy
OL,19,Fsaid Friday in a post on Telegram.
