OL,3,CRussia hits Kyiv with ballistic
OL,4,Cmissiles and drones, killing at least
OL,5,Cnine
OL,7,FAt a Nato summit in Ankara in July,
OL,8,FTrump said the US would give Ukraine a
OL,9,Flicense to make Patriot systems, but
OL,10,Fhe appeared to move away from that
OL,11,Fcommitment on Friday during a Cabinet
OL,12,Fmeeting at the presidential retreat in
OL,13,FCamp David, Maryland, saying he had
OL,14,Fnot yet made a final decision on the
OL,15,Fmatter.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/10
