OL,3,CRussia hits Kyiv with ballistic
OL,4,Cmissiles and drones, killing at least
OL,5,Cnine
OL,7,FSaturday's attack on Kyiv came just
OL,8,Ftwo days after a large-scale Russian
OL,9,Fballistic missile and drone attack
OL,10,Facross Ukraine killed 10 civilians and
OL,11,Fwounded more than 50 others and saw a
OL,12,FRussian missile enter Polish airspace.
OL,14,FFrom a basement shelter where she was
OL,15,Ftaking cover as a second air alarm
OL,16,Fsounded for another wave, Liudmyla
OL,17,FNakonechna, 64, described how she was
OL,18,Fwoken by loud explosions at 1.30 a.m.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
