CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1785633476
OL,3,CRussia hits Kyiv with ballistic
OL,4,Cmissiles and drones, killing at least
OL,5,Cnine
OL,7,F"I ran into the corridor and was
OL,8,Fstanding there when the bathroom door
OL,9,Fwas blown off its hinges and struck me
OL,10,Fin the leg," said Nakonechna, whose
OL,11,Fhealth is poor after undergoing cancer
OL,12,Ftreatment.
OL,14,F"I heard the sound of shattering
OL,15,Fglass. My balcony was covered in glass
OL,16,Fand it was completely blown apart,
OL,17,Fwhile the windows in my bedroom were
OL,18,Falso blown out."
OL,26,@oD@AOUrD@LO]vD@AOUzD@PO]
