CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1785633476
OL,3,CRussia hits Kyiv with ballistic
OL,4,Cmissiles and drones, killing at least
OL,5,Cnine
OL,7,FNakonechna had not taken cover in a
OL,8,Fshelter since Russia's full-scale
OL,9,Finvasion on February 24, 2022, but the
OL,10,Fstress became too much, she said.
OL,12,F"It's getting worse by the day,"
OL,13,FNakonechna said. "Whereas before there
OL,14,Fwas an attack once every two weeks, or
OL,15,Fmaybe once a week, now it happens
OL,16,Fpractically every day. It is
OL,17,Fincredibly hard to bear this
OL,18,Fpsychologically."
OL,26,@tD@AOUtD@`O]uD@ROUzD@QO]
